meanings
  agentic_formalization_report
    defined-by output
    role output_display_request
    precondition "A source document has an observed FormalizationSummary."
    effect "Report the observed covered count, total primitive count and knowledge base; do not infer coverage from the scheme declaration."
    unit "count"
    example "Two observed primitive kinds out of nine declared kinds are reported as 2 of 9."
    grounding "src/agentic_coding/formalization_recipe.rs::final_answer"
