  agentic_formalization_need_report
    defined-by output
    role output_display_request
    precondition "A formalization grounded a ConceptGraph that raised needs."
    effect "Report how many needs the formalization raised and how many the consulted sources grounded, in the prompt's language; never present an unresolved need as grounded."
    unit "count"
    example "needs_raised 7; needs_grounded 3."
    grounding "src/agentic_coding/formalization_recipe.rs::final_answer"
